      "content": "hey, i'm starting a new series on my philosophy blog about \"modern morality\" in today's world. since everything is so digital and multicultural now, i'm trying to figure out what the core values should be. if you had to define the most important virtues for a citizen in a modern, multicultural, digital-age democracy, what would they be?",
